    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 143 Castle Park to the market, a spacious three-bedroom home offering an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers looking to get their foot on the property ladder or for savvy investors seeking strong rental returns.\n\nThe property is well laid out with bright and comfortable living accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, a cosy living room, an open-plan kitchen/dining area, and a family bathroom. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, perfect for family living or rental potential.\n\nTo the rear, you'll find a large, low-maintenance paved garden with a sunny aspect and the added benefit of rear vehicular access. The front of the property offers a beautiful front garden and overlooks a large green space, ideal for families.\n\nNo. 143 enjoys an unbeatable location with every convenience on your doorstep, including a wide range of schools, shops, leisure facilities, Tallaght Village, Tallaght Hospital, Glenview Post Office, The Square Shopping Centre, and excellent transport links such as the Luas and major road networks including the M50.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the potential of this well-located home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPlease see 3D Tour for layout & dimensions - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=EbvUz2G8t8a\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 bed end of terrace property</li><li> Kitchen extension</li><li> 1 bathroom (downstairs)</li><li> DG windows & GFCH</li><li> Large private rear garden with sunny facing orientation</li><li> Rear gated access to the property that can comfortably park 2 cars</li><li> Overlooking large green</li><li> Close to all main transport links and amenities</li><li> Highly sought after development</ul>"
      },
      {
